    ! #218: "**Grounding checks:** After knowledge-base passages are retrieved, the assistant now runs a grounding check before streaming its first answer token if it has not already checked." - The check is forced before the first streamed token when passages are present and no check has run, but the mechanism guarantees only one check after retrieval—not a new check after every retrieval.
